<title>UK: Sherwood rises on link-up with Deloitte.</title>
<headline>Sherwood rises on link-up with Deloitte.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in software producer Sherwood International jumped on Thursday after it announced a strategic alliance with the Deloitte &amp; Touche Consulting Group in North America, dealers said.</p>
<p>Sherwood shares gained 20-1/2p to 281-1/2p by 1416 GMT.  </p>
<p>Sherwood, a provider of solutions to the insurance industry, said Deloitte would implement and market Amarta, its leading life and pensions software in potentially the largest single market for Sherwood products.</p>
<p>--Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
